00:57:19.000 --> 00:57:24.840
<v Ingrid Lafleur>It was, like, 110% black. It was super-black. It was just black.
<v Ingrid Lafleur>它就像，110%黑人。它超级黑。它就是黑人。

00:57:24.840 --> 00:57:29.840
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
